{"1582930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Constellations","steam_appid":1582930,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5380140],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/fa33a07fc7205eef5ccc4a15a1f5ad38.avif?t=1793712881\" width=480 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/2388199361ff167ec469b3e6bd81e730.poster.avif?t=1793712881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/2388199361ff167ec469b3e6bd81e730.webm?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/2388199361ff167ec469b3e6bd81e730.mp4?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constellations is a relaxing puzzle game about <strong>connecting stars<\/strong>, completing constellations, and watching their shapes emerge from the starry sky. Complete all 88 constellations recognized by the International Astronomical Union (IAU) and discover who catalogued each one and when.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/a42fbe22f215694dfcbf48a424686fca.avif?t=1793712881\" width=480 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/903e72b8a294bf7c87f90b9b2200ed80.poster.avif?t=1793712881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/903e72b8a294bf7c87f90b9b2200ed80.webm?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/903e72b8a294bf7c87f90b9b2200ed80.mp4?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each connection between stars plays a random note from the same musical scale, allowing a <strong>unique melody<\/strong> to unfold as you play. Each constellation has its own distinctive sound. With no time limit, you can slow down and enjoy every moment at your own pace. The ambient soundtrack, with its space-inspired atmosphere, adds depth and intensity to the journey. It can be adjusted or muted separately, while keeping the sounds of the star connections and constellations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/7279922be0f553ba6f9d085abb7c84a6.avif?t=1793712881\" width=480 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/4b37f06582e6da7b527682304904ace0.poster.avif?t=1793712881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/4b37f06582e6da7b527682304904ace0.webm?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/4b37f06582e6da7b527682304904ace0.mp4?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you complete constellations, new cosmic events are unlocked through the <strong>Orbit<\/strong>. Stardust, shooting stars, moons, auroras, nebulae, planets, and other phenomena become part of the sky. Once unlocked, these events can appear randomly while you play, sometimes even happening at the same time and creating <strong>unexpected combinations<\/strong>. The further you progress, the more alive and unpredictable the sky becomes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/64fb0b9ae969a05656833b281016e9c2.avif?t=1793712881\" width=480 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/9b78068ebe24dfee08ec40236e4f6144.poster.avif?t=1793712881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/9b78068ebe24dfee08ec40236e4f6144.webm?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/9b78068ebe24dfee08ec40236e4f6144.mp4?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit completed constellations in the <strong>Catalogue<\/strong> and work your way toward the full collection. Discover familiar names and lesser-known figures as your journey unfolds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist connect-the-stars <strong>puzzles<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All <strong>88 constellations<\/strong> to complete.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Catalog<\/strong> to revisit completed constellations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic events<\/strong> such as shooting stars, comets, auroras, and more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>progression system<\/strong> that makes the sky increasingly active.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural constellations<\/strong> for players to draw and name.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/fa33a07fc7205eef5ccc4a15a1f5ad38.avif?t=1793712881\" width=480 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/2388199361ff167ec469b3e6bd81e730.poster.avif?t=1793712881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/2388199361ff167ec469b3e6bd81e730.webm?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/2388199361ff167ec469b3e6bd81e730.mp4?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constellations is a relaxing puzzle game about <strong>connecting stars<\/strong>, completing constellations, and watching their shapes emerge from the starry sky. Complete all 88 constellations recognized by the International Astronomical Union (IAU) and discover who catalogued each one and when.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/a42fbe22f215694dfcbf48a424686fca.avif?t=1793712881\" width=480 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/903e72b8a294bf7c87f90b9b2200ed80.poster.avif?t=1793712881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/903e72b8a294bf7c87f90b9b2200ed80.webm?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/903e72b8a294bf7c87f90b9b2200ed80.mp4?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each connection between stars plays a random note from the same musical scale, allowing a <strong>unique melody<\/strong> to unfold as you play. Each constellation has its own distinctive sound. With no time limit, you can slow down and enjoy every moment at your own pace. The ambient soundtrack, with its space-inspired atmosphere, adds depth and intensity to the journey. It can be adjusted or muted separately, while keeping the sounds of the star connections and constellations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/7279922be0f553ba6f9d085abb7c84a6.avif?t=1793712881\" width=480 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/4b37f06582e6da7b527682304904ace0.poster.avif?t=1793712881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/4b37f06582e6da7b527682304904ace0.webm?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/4b37f06582e6da7b527682304904ace0.mp4?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you complete constellations, new cosmic events are unlocked through the <strong>Orbit<\/strong>. Stardust, shooting stars, moons, auroras, nebulae, planets, and other phenomena become part of the sky. Once unlocked, these events can appear randomly while you play, sometimes even happening at the same time and creating <strong>unexpected combinations<\/strong>. The further you progress, the more alive and unpredictable the sky becomes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/64fb0b9ae969a05656833b281016e9c2.avif?t=1793712881\" width=480 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/9b78068ebe24dfee08ec40236e4f6144.poster.avif?t=1793712881\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/9b78068ebe24dfee08ec40236e4f6144.webm?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/extras\/9b78068ebe24dfee08ec40236e4f6144.mp4?t=1793712881\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit completed constellations in the <strong>Catalogue<\/strong> and work your way toward the full collection. Discover familiar names and lesser-known figures as your journey unfolds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist connect-the-stars <strong>puzzles<\/strong>.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All <strong>88 constellations<\/strong> to complete.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Catalog<\/strong> to revisit completed constellations.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic events<\/strong> such as shooting stars, comets, auroras, and more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>progression system<\/strong> that makes the sky increasingly active.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural constellations<\/strong> for players to draw and name.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Connect the stars to reveal each constellation in a minimalist puzzle game inspired by all 88 real-world constellations. Revisit your discoveries in the Catalogue, play at your own pace and enjoy the journey through an imagined sky.","supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Russian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/d57160957b65645c23335cd5096a792d0c6c49ac\/header.jpg?t=1793712881","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/a902b32a5f98808df49f47c04854f6f615cd2148\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793712881","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/a902b32a5f98808df49f47c04854f6f615cd2148\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793712881","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD FX-4300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> AMD Radeon HD 6570<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> AMD Radeon R7 360<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Accidental Feature"],"publishers":["Accidental Feature"],"demos":[{"appid":5380140,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":299,"final":269,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$2.99","final_formatted":"$2.69"},"packages":[560119],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Constellations","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":560119,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Constellations - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$2.99<\/span> $2.69","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":269}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1582930\/1